---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | Get Micro Tools";
const description = "Learn how Get Micro Tools handles your data. We prioritize your privacy and aim for maximum transparency in our operations.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Nav />
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-24">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-display-md text-ink mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted">Last updated: June 17, 2026</p>
    </header>
    
    <div class="space-y-8 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>At Get Micro Tools, accessible from <a href="https://getmicrotools.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">https://getmicrotools.com</a>, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of information we collect, how we use it, and your options regarding cookies and advertising.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">2. Client-Side Processing & Data Minimization</h2>
        <p>Our core utilities—including the ROI Calculator, ROAS & Profitability Engine, Instagram Engagement Rate Calculator, TikTok Bio Checker, and Instagram Reels Overlay Tester—are engineered to execute calculations locally inside your web browser using client-side JavaScript. <strong>We do not upload, collect, or store your financial figures, ad campaign data, social media metrics, or uploaded test media on our servers.</strong></p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">3. Information We Automatically Collect</h2>
        <p>Like most websites, we may collect non-personally identifiable information automatically when you visit our site:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Log Files & Technical Data:</strong> Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser types, Internet Service Providers (ISPs), date/time stamps, referring/exit pages, and number of clicks for security, site performance, and administration.</li>
          <li><strong>Analytics Data:</strong> Aggregate traffic metrics, page views, and user engagement trends collected via Google Analytics 4 (GA4).</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">4. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>Get Micro Tools uses cookies to store information about visitors' preferences, record user-specific information on which pages the user visits, and customize web page content based on visitors' browser type or other information.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">5. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Disclosures</h2>
        <p>Google is a third-party vendor on our site. Google uses cookies, including DART cookies and advertising identifiers, to serve ads to visitors based on their visit to getmicrotools.com and other websites across the internet.</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-2">
          <li>Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visits to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Google Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">www.aboutads.info</a> or <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Your Online Choices</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">6. Google Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics to analyze how visitors use our website. Google Analytics gathers information about website use by means of cookies. You can prevent Google Analytics from tracking your visits by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">7. Third-Party Privacy Policies</h2>
        <p>Get Micro Tools' Privacy Policy does not apply to other advertisers or websites. We advise you to consult the respective Privacy Policies of these third-party ad servers or analytics providers for more detailed information on their practices and opt-out procedures.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">8. GDPR & CCPA/CPRA Privacy Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your geographic location, you have rights under applicable privacy legislation, including the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data, and the right to opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-title-sm text-ink mb-3">9. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@getmicrotools.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">hello@getmicrotools.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
